    <string name="info_button">Info</string>
    <string name="info_title_dialog">About Sengled Lights</string>
    <string name="info_section_how">How does it work?</string>
    <string name="info_section_how_text">Controls your Sengled W21-N11 bulbs directly over your local network (WiFi), no external servers needed. Communicates via UDP to turn on, off, and adjust brightness.</string>
    <string name="info_section_routines">Routines</string>
    <string name="info_section_routines_text">Schedule on/off times for each bulb. When your phone connects to WiFi, the app executes actions automatically.</string>
    <string name="info_section_router">Router configuration</string>
    <string name="info_section_router_text">Add each bulb\'s IP and MAC as a static IP in your router. This way the bulb keeps the same address and the app never loses connection.</string>
    <string name="info_section_wifi">Why WiFi 2.4 GHz?</string>
    <string name="info_section_wifi_text">Sengled W21-N11 bulbs only work on 2.4 GHz networks. Better range and wall penetration than 5 GHz, ideal for IoT devices.</string>
    <string name="info_section_contact">Have a question or suggestion about this app?</string>
    <string name="info_section_contact_text">If you have an improvement or new feature in mind, write me at:\n\n<b>fere.espiritu@gmail.com</b>\n\nWe will review if the proposed functionality is viable.\n\nThe app is available on my GitHub repository:\nhttps://github.com/espiritu1/sengled-local-control</string>

